              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakukho lelilodwa ilizwi uMose alilayayo angalifundanga uJoshuwa phambi kwebandla lakoIsrayeli kanye labesifazana labantwana labezizweni abahlala phakathi kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
